\ Permissive AOT build (--interpreter-fallback=true) plus
\ --compile-all-prelude forces some prelude bodies into the compiled set
\ even though their callees are uncompilable, producing
\ `compound_uncompiled` fallback sites. The binary therefore needs
\ `jitInterpretedCall`, which `1z inspect` should surface as
\ `jit-interpreted-call=yes`.
